### ECDSA flow

### 1. Create ECDSA credential request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/credentials/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credentialType": "UniversityDegree",
  "claims": {
    "first_name": "Ivan",
    "last_name": "Petrenko",
    "birth_date": "2000-01-01",
    "student_id": "12345",
    "graduation_year": "2024",
    "faculty": "Computer Science",
    "degree": "Bachelor"
  }
}

### 2. Check pending requests
GET http://localhost:8080/api/credentials/requests

### 3. Approve ECDSA request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/credentials/requests/1/approve

### 4. Check approved requests
GET http://localhost:8080/api/credentials/requests?status=APPROVED

### 5. Verify request in detail
GET http://localhost:8080/api/credentials/requests/1




